"{\"url\":\"https://www.microcision.com/cnc-swiss-operators\",\"title\":\"CNC SWISS MACHINE SET/UP AND OPERATORS | Microcision\",\"desc\":null,\"og\":null,\"robots\":null,\"imgs\":[\"Microcision logo.png | 31e942_ef154a865afe4fa79723417987ebbaeb~mv2.png\"],\"form\":[],\"iframes\":[],\"sha256\":\"8cb21c655ca4b73a867861d9c14985daa59d24d5eb77737a6860006b473d09b3\",\"text\":\"Skip to Main Content\\n\\nHOME\\n\\nSERVICES\\n\\nABOUT\\n\\nEXPANSION\\n\\nCAREERS\\n\\nCONTACT\\n\\nCNC SWISS MACHINE SET/UP AND OPERATORS\\n\\nMicrocision has openings in our expanding CNC Swiss Department. We are seeking experienced operators and set-up staff for both first and second shifts.\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nPotential candidates should have:\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\n1-3+ years of experience operating Citizen, Star, and/or Tsugami CNC Swiss machines\\n\\nWell-developed math skills, preferably in geometry\\n\\nUnderstanding of metric and inch measurements\\n\\nPossess good mechanical aptitude, good manual dexterity, knowledge of tools and their use\\n\\nAbility to interpret prints, and tolerances\\n\\nTask-oriented, a demonstrated ability to learn, work independently and under instruction as needed\\n\\nExperience with tolerances to 0.0001 inches\\n\\nStrong oral and written communication skills in English\\n\\nAn ability to work overtime when necessary\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nRequired education:\\n\\nHigh school or equivalent\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nRequired experience:\\n\\nExperience in Citizen, Star, and/or Tsugami CNC Swiss machines\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nJob type: Full-time\\n\\n\\u200bPay: $15.00 - $28.00 per hour\\n\\n\\u00a9 2022\\u00a0by Microcision LLC\"}"
